Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,IN“Bright Way”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:36.16,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}ずっと探し続けていた進むべき道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:43.24,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}つまらない日常を塗り替えて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.29,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}さあ Bright step
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.65,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}踏み出した一歩が
Comment: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:48.83,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}Bright will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.85,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}意志に変わる
Comment: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:52.44,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}So bright way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:58.01,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}夢中になれる心が指差す
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:02.17,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}まぶしい道しるべ
Comment: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.81,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}All ready, I’m ready
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.89,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}すでに願うだけじゃ足りない
Comment: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.94,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}All ready, You’re ready
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:17.29,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}はやる素直な鼓動を止まらないね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:24.00,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}きっと今はほんのプロローグのまんなか
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:32.67,IN-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}がんばりたいって思える自分のはじまりをうたおう
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.77,0:03:36.16,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}一直在找寻前进的方向
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.16,0:03:43.24,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}想改写这无聊的日常
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.29,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}来吧 Bright step
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.65,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}踏出的这一步
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.65,0:03:48.83,IN-CH,,0,0,20,,{\fad(360,360)\fscx110\fscy110}Bright will
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.85,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}成为我们的意志
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.85,0:03:52.44,IN-CH,,0,0,20,,{\fad(360,360)\fscx110\fscy110}So bright way
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.78,0:03:58.01,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}忘我的心指引方向
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.20,0:04:02.17,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}成为耀眼的路标
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.81,IN-CH,,0,0,20,,{\fad(360,360)\fscx110\fscy110}All ready, I’m ready
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.89,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}已经不能止步于愿望
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.94,IN-CH,,0,0,20,,{\fad(360,360)\fscx110\fscy110}All ready, You’re ready
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.94,0:04:17.29,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}真切的心悸动不已
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.29,0:04:24.00,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}现在一定还只是故事的序章
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.20,0:04:32.67,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)}为励志启程的自己而歌唱吧
Comment: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,OP「ゴールデンレイ」
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.08,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}昨日気付いたんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}歩き出そうとして
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}いつもの靴が小さかった
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}笑われちゃうかもな
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.05,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}海を見る君が
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.59,0:01:12.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}なんだか大人びていた
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.81,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}どれが宝物
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.81,0:01:21.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}どれが好きなこと
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}失くしてから気付くでしょ
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.90,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}あたりまえの空の下に
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.90,0:01:29.90,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}多分隠れてる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}また朝が来て
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.99,0:01:36.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}リボンを蝶々に結んで
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.74,0:01:43.37,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}まだ温かい少女の見た夢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}止まらないで行こう
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}光る方へ行こう
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.84,0:01:52.13,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}僕らは戻れない
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.13,0:01:54.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}手を握ってゴールデンレイ
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.34,0:01:56.68,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}まだ傍にいる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.60,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}まだ傍にいる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}止まらないで行こう
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}望む方へ行こう
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.68,0:02:04.14,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}僕らが選んだ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.14,0:02:06.36,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}なけなしのゴールデンレイ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}まだ傍にいる
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.32,0:02:13.15,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)}まだ傍にいるから
